#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:5 63ce11ddd5474db7be2f7ae4bfbb21a0
msgid "FlowHold Mode"
msgstr "FlowHold 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:7 d90bffce81814032bd38f02aea6f0a9a
msgid ""
"FlowHold mode uses an :ref:`optical flow sensor <common-optical-flow-"
"sensors-landingpage>` to hold position without the need for a GPS nor a "
"downward facing Lidar.  Better performance can be achieved by attaching a "
":ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` and using regular "
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` mode instead"
msgstr ""
"FlowHold 模式使用 :ref:`光流传感器 <common-optical-flow-sensors-landingpage>` 在不需要 "
"GPS 也不需要向下激光雷达的情况下保持位置。通过安装 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` "
"并使用常规 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式可获得更好的性能"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:14 53df00e2d7f448d4bd236e064919e30c
msgid ""
"With many vehicles this mode results in wobbling and unstable position hold."
"  If possible we recommend attaching a :ref:`rangefinder <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>` and using regular :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` "
"instead"
msgstr ""
"对许多飞行器而言，此模式会导致摇晃和不稳定的定点悬停。如果可能，建议安装 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>` 并改用常规 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:16 ec348797d049474d9d18134ca26f0df9
msgid ""
"FlowHold mode is similar to PosHold mode in that the pilot directly controls"
" the vehicle's lean angles with the roll and pitch sticks.  When the user "
"releases the sticks, the optical flow sensor is used by the autopilot to "
"bring the vehicle to a stop."
msgstr ""
"FlowHold 模式与 PosHold 模式类似，飞手可通过横滚和俯仰摇杆直接控制飞行器的倾斜角。当用户松开摇杆时，飞控使用光流传感器使飞行器停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:18 1abf0c8e73e94a4f8328b0f2db0e48ab
msgid ""
"Because no Lidar is used in this mode, the optical flow sensor is used both "
"to estimate the vehicle's height above the surface and the vehicle's speed."
"  Soon after takeoff or after there have been large changes in the height "
"above the surface the vehicle may wobble as it learns the new height and "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"由于此模式不使用激光雷达，光流传感器同时用于估计飞行器离地高度和飞行器速度。起飞后不久或离地高度发生较大变化后，飞行器在学习新高度和速度时可能会出现摇晃。"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:20 7e12a57d0ce84a4181465390eb7ec3ab
msgid "The following parameters can be used to tune FlowHold's performance:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整 FlowHold 的性能："

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:22 c3b50bd562c0442ea9dbaf54ebdf1601
msgid ""
":ref:`FHLD_BRAKE_RATE <FHLD_BRAKE_RATE>` controls the desired deceleration "
"rate when the pilot releases the sticks"
msgstr ":ref:`FHLD_BRAKE_RATE <FHLD_BRAKE_RATE>` 控制飞手松开摇杆时的期望减速率"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:23 854a7a48fd5e46c896bf41483c4c36b6
msgid ""
":ref:`FHLD_FILT_HZ <FHLD_FILT_HZ>` is the filter applied to the optical flow"
" sensor data"
msgstr ":ref:`FHLD_FILT_HZ <FHLD_FILT_HZ>` 是应用于光流传感器数据的滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:24 78faa6e5271b4ab7bdf319c38395c645
msgid ""
":ref:`FHLD_FLOW_MAX <FHLD_FLOW_MAX>` is the optical flow sensor's maximum "
"rate (in m/s) used when stopping"
msgstr ":ref:`FHLD_FLOW_MAX <FHLD_FLOW_MAX>` 是光流传感器停止时使用的最大速率（单位：m/s）"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:25 b06c898089324bebb6764c8c08efd3e0
msgid ""
":ref:`FHLD_QUAL_MIN <FHLD_QUAL_MIN>` is the minimum flow quality used.  If "
"the flow sensor quality falls below this value, FlowHold will act just like "
"AltHold"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FHLD_QUAL_MIN <FHLD_QUAL_MIN>` 是使用的最低光流质量。如果光流传感器质量低于此值，FlowHold 将像 "
"AltHold 一样工作"

#: ../../source/docs/flowhold-mode.rst:26 b42486aefa3f4c408ee81d6b86d095db
msgid ""
":ref:`FHLD_XY_P <FHLD_XY_P>`, :ref:`FHLD_XY_I <FHLD_XY_I>`, "
":ref:`FHLD_XY_IMAX <FHLD_XY_IMAX>` and :ref:`FHLD_XY_FILT_HZ "
"<FHLD_XY_FILT_HZ>` gains to tune the stopping response"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FHLD_XY_P <FHLD_XY_P>`、:ref:`FHLD_XY_I <FHLD_XY_I>`、:ref:`FHLD_XY_IMAX"
" <FHLD_XY_IMAX>` 和 :ref:`FHLD_XY_FILT_HZ <FHLD_XY_FILT_HZ>` 增益用于调整停止响应"
